## 3. Mapping side-effects (`ownerMapper.toOwner`)
File: `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/mapper/OwnerMapper.java` (MapStruct). The `toOwner(OwnerFieldsDto)` mapping ignores `id` and `pets`, and maps `registrationDate` via `defaultRegistrationDate`:
```java
@Named("defaultRegistrationDate")
default LocalDate defaultRegistrationDate(LocalDate registrationDate) {
    return BusinessDay.rollForward(registrationDate == null ? LocalDate.now() : registrationDate);
