So a missing `registrationDate` defaults to today (2026-09-04), then any weekend date rolls forward to Monday (`BusinessDay.rollForward`, `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/util/BusinessDay.java`).

