6. **`CustomerCode.assign`** → sets `customerCode` formatted `<CITY3>-<LAST3>-<NNNN>`, NNNN = per-city sequence (count of existing owners in that city + 1). File `.../util/CustomerCode.java`.
7. **`Namesakes.count`** → sets `namesakeCount` = number of existing owners sharing first+last name (case-insensitive). File `.../util/Namesakes.java`.
8. **`clinicService.saveOwner(owner)`** — see below.
9. **AUDIT log** line emitted via SLF4J logger named "AUDIT".
10. Response mapped back via `ownerMapper.toOwnerDto` (computes derived fields: `displayName`, `initials`, `householdId` via `Household.idFor`, `membershipNumber`, `membershipLevel`, `locality`, `contactPreference`, `identityKey`), `bulkSignupWarning` set, `Location` header set, returns **201 Created**.

